    "calories": 175,
    "netCarbsGrams": 2.8,
    "proteinGrams": 3,
    "fatGrams": 16.7
  },
  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "1 cup almond flour",
    "1/4 cup stevia/erythritol blend",
    "1/4 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1/4 teaspoon salt (to taste)",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/4 cup butter (diced)",
    "10 ounce strawberries (frozen, no added sugar added)",
    "1 tablespoon lemon juice",
    "1/4 cup water",
    "1 1/4 teaspoon unflavored gelatin",
    "1/3 cup stevia/erythritol blend",
    "1 cup heavy whipping cream"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prepare all ingredients. Defrost the strawberries.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375F and grease a pie or tart pan with butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine the almond flour, stevia/erythritol blend, baking soda, and salt into a food processor. Pulse it a few times to mix it all together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the butter and vanilla extract. Pulse this until you get a dough mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put the dough in the greased pan and form it to the sides. Poke the bottom with a fork.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place in the oven for 8-10 minutes and allow to cool completely before adding the strawberry cream.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add water to a pan then sprinkle in the unflavored gelatin and let sit for 3-5 minutes. This is called blooming and an important step in order for the gelatin to be smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the frozen but defrosted strawberries into a blender along with the lemon juice. Blend this until smooth. Leave this mixture in the blender and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the gelatin is done blooming, add the stevia/erythritol blend to the pan. Heat on low and stir constantly until everything is mixed well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Have the blender on at its lowest setting and pour the heated mixture into the blender in the small opening on the blender.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer this to a mixing bowl and refrigerate for a few minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a mixing bowl, whip the heavy whipping cream until stiff peaks form.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the whipping cream mixture into the strawberry mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together until everything is well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-13",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-14.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour this mixture on top of the cooled pie crust.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-14",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Keto-Strawberry-Cream-Pie-15.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover the pie and let it sit in the refrigerator for 5 hours before enjoying.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-strawberry-cream-pie/#wprm-recipe-53689-step-0-15",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
